# Deploy backend

- Landing commits on **`deploy/dev` via an approved PR** runs [`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`](../../.github/workflows/deploy.yml) (SSH → `/home/ubuntu/deploy.sh` on Oracle VM).
- **Never commit or push directly to `deploy/dev`.** Open a PR into `deploy/dev`, wait for review time, merge only with ≥1 approval.
- Feature work stays on feature branches → PR → merge path the user specifies.
- **Live BE only when the user explicitly asks to deploy.**
- Never force-push `deploy/dev`.
- For the deploy checklist, use the `deploy-backend` skill (which runs `review-before-push` first).
